  "name": "Qwen-Planner-Agent: A Closed-Loop AI-for-AI Framework for Real-World Mobile Planner Agents",
  "notes": "Primarily typed tool actions and structured feedback, not pixel-coordinate GUI control; backends combine programmatic sandboxes, LLM simulation and selected real-device sessions. No specific OS is established. Model/harness updates are reviewed offline, not autonomous serving-time changes. Co-evolution scores use an evolve/development set; output-cost estimates exclude input, tools, devices and harness processing. Memory comparisons differ in history access and processing cost; user authorization relies on trusted upstream services. No independent reproduction.",
  "published_at": "2026-09-24",
  "relations": [],
  "review_status": "curated",
  "scope": "core",
  "summary": "Trains a mobile planner with supervised trajectories and competence-adaptive RL, then couples typed tool execution with memory, skills and offline model-harness refinement.",
